// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1090200292" "Uppercut"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4263165877" "Melee, Superior DMG (Smashing), Knockup (Foe), Chance for Stun (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2408961328" "You perform a jaw breaking Crushing Uppercut on your target inflicting Extreme Smashing damage and knocking them into the air.  Crushing Uppercut will leave the target disoriented for a short time. Crushing Uppercut is a Finisher and will set your Combo Level to 0. It will deal additional damage and have a longer disorient duration dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Crushing Uppercut will have its disorient effect upgraded to a Hold effect. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2848422893" "Disorient"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2366756416" "You have been Disoriented."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2392306370" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4008042672" "You have been knocked into the air by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nova Fist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3728736408" "Nova Fist"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3949166828" "PBAoE, Extreme DMG (Smashing/Energy), Knockback (Foe), Chance for Stun (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3457594466" "You slam the ground, unleashing a wave of energy that devastates the foes around you. This causes smashing and energy damage, as well as knocking affected foes back. Affected targets will be stunned by the force of this attack."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2479728621" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with his {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P705039065" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} also strikes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hand Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4070616617" "Hand Clap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3848605547" "PBAoE, Knockback (Foe), Chance for Stun (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1357054938" "Using your massive strength, you clap your hands together with such power that you create a shockwave which knocks foes around you back. There is also a chance that affected targets are stunned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Foot Stomp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3599889667" "{PlayerSource} shakes the very Earth with his {PowerName}, dealing {Damage} points of smashing Damage to you."

